UNderstanding the Playwright config

The first file we are going to see is the playwright.condig.ts. This file has all the configurations for the tests that we
are going to implement in our project.

The first line has the first import.

It comes from @playwright/test, and it has  the defineConfig, which is the object with all the configurations and the 
devices that we run the tests on - the browsers or the mobile devices - if we need.
